global gFarg

on moveCursor flagga
  [  0] pushint8 5 .............................. <5>
  [  2] pusharglist 1 ........................... <5>
  [  4] extcall 20 .............................. <rollOver(5)>
  [  6] pushint8 6 .............................. <6>
  [  8] pusharglist 1 ........................... <6>
  [ 10] extcall 20 .............................. <rollOver(6)>
  [ 12] or ...................................... <rollOver(5) or rollOver(6)>
  [ 13] setlocal 0 .............................. knappFlagga = rollOver(5) or rollOver(6)
  [ 15] getlocal 0 .............................. <knappFlagga>
  [ 17] getparam 0 .............................. <flagga>
  [ 19] or ...................................... <knappFlagga or flagga>
  [ 20] jmpifz [ 62] ............................ if knappFlagga or flagga then / else
  [ 23] getlocal 0 .............................. <knappFlagga>
  [ 25] jmpifz [ 45] ............................ if knappFlagga then / else
  [ 28] pushint8 133 ............................ <133>
  [ 31] pushint8 134 ............................ <134>
  [ 34] pusharglist 2 ........................... <133, 134>
  [ 36] extcall 29 .............................. <list(133, 134)>
  [ 38] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <list(133, 134)>
  [ 40] extcall 28 .............................. cursor(list(133, 134))
  [ 42] jmp [ 52]
  [ 45] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 47] inv ..................................... <-1>
  [ 48] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <-1>
  [ 50] extcall 28 .............................. cursor(-1)
  [ 52] pushint8 31 ............................. <31>
  [ 54] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 55] pushint8 25 ............................. <25>
  [ 57] set 6 ................................... set the visible of sprite 31 to 0
  [ 59] jmp [107]
  [ 62] pushint8 200 ............................ <200>
  [ 65] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <200>
  [ 67] extcall 28 .............................. cursor(200)
  [ 69] pushint8 31 ............................. <31>
  [ 71] pushint8 135 ............................ <135>
  [ 74] getglobal 4 ............................. <gFarg>
  [ 76] add ..................................... <135 + gFarg>
  [ 77] pushint8 35 ............................. <35>
  [ 79] set 6 ................................... set the memberNum of sprite 31 to 135 + gFarg
  [ 81] pushint8 31 ............................. <31>
  [ 83] pusharglist 0 ........................... <>
  [ 85] thebuiltin 32 ........................... <the mouseH>
  [ 87] pusharglist 0 ........................... <>
  [ 89] thebuiltin 33 ........................... <the mouseV>
  [ 91] pusharglist 2 ........................... <the mouseH, the mouseV>
  [ 93] extcall 31 .............................. <point(the mouseH, the mouseV)>
  [ 95] pushint8 33 ............................. <33>
  [ 97] set 6 ................................... set the loc of sprite 31 to point(the mouseH, the mouseV)
  [ 99] pushint8 31 ............................. <31>
  [101] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [103] pushint8 25 ............................. <25>
  [105] set 6 ................................... set the visible of sprite 31 to 1
  [107] ret
end

on checkButtons
  [  0] pushint8 5 .............................. <5>
  [  2] pushint8 5 .............................. <5>
  [  4] pusharglist 1 ........................... <5>
  [  6] extcall 20 .............................. <rollOver(5)>
  [  8] pushint8 25 ............................. <25>
  [ 10] set 6 ................................... set the visible of sprite 5 to rollOver(5)
  [ 12] pushint8 6 .............................. <6>
  [ 14] pushint8 6 .............................. <6>
  [ 16] pusharglist 1 ........................... <6>
  [ 18] extcall 20 .............................. <rollOver(6)>
  [ 20] pushint8 25 ............................. <25>
  [ 22] set 6 ................................... set the visible of sprite 6 to rollOver(6)
  [ 24] ret
end
